{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0364_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a1b79f125b333703c115b8643dd5067e987d72d291d6244e0a502ae3f2071a86", "ja": "（響の新しい衣装は、曲のカッコよさに合わせて、\n考えてみた！　響は気に入ってくれるかな？）", "zh": "（我试着根据歌曲的帅气风格，设计了响的新服装！响会喜欢吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0364_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "62b476e83bd9a68003401b92263befea95d85b3203a87d0e795dc3c46c5bbfc5", "ja": "{$P$}、どうどう？　やっぱり\n自分、こういうカッコいい系も決まってない？", "zh": "{$P$}，怎么样怎么样？果然，我也很适合这种帅气风格吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0364_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b51eae9a2e25f94e1b281e369be0e0c836593520f73560abb53af6e348129ab8", "ja": "ああ！　響の曲『Rebellion』をイメージして\n作ってみたんだけど、ピッタリだな。", "zh": "啊！我是以响的歌曲《Rebellion》为灵感做出来的，果然很合适。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0364_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "b52d3e4a5510aed066c8bcf208ea68359d7548dd4dbfebd1b88a40880ebaa50c", "ja": "そっか、あの曲のイメージだったんだね。\nだからこんなにクールで……えへへ♪", "zh": "这样啊，原来是以那首歌的感觉为灵感创作的。\n难怪这么酷……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0364_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "aea28cefa8f39928b7d44b74972fca31bc486a70fa965b02f49c31c5342c976e", "ja": "カッコいい衣装もカワイイ衣装も好きだけど、\nこの衣装は、ちょっと違う感じがするんだ。", "zh": "帅气的服装和可爱的服装我都喜欢，\n但这套服装，感觉有点不一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0364_1005_p", "source_sha256": "d6179d34c136e29245c00ece9c402f6c0931f5d84addaf39d92913aeb967b6f1", "ja": "へえ。そうなのか？", "zh": "哦，是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0364_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "f2a55d067b23b5d1851b23d12676fef0d9bb6530157a4ddde3f9a519e3b37d0c", "ja": "うん。言葉にするのは難しいんだけど……\nなんか強くなった気がする！", "zh": "嗯。虽然很难用语言表达……\n但总觉得整个人变强了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0364_1007_p", "source_sha256": "166e97fb8f4ef4d3dcf3c861a0fc5dea06ddc0af75010c78726fc0f72514cc05", "ja": "強くか……。確かに、そうだな。アイドルの衣装は、\nアイドルを強くする武器みたいなものだからな。", "zh": "变强吗……确实是这样呢。偶像的服装，\n就像是让偶像变强的武器一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0364_1008_p", "source_sha256": "c9f0372229c0a5b4b960eb06785bde96d8d11138559a011b45e4823b0dc6bd6e", "ja": "衣装を着て、響はパワーアップしたってことだな！", "zh": "也就是说，穿上衣装之后，响就变得更强了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0364_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "3c45ff78c593420e1ebd69d36b4b2eacf1136268617c71d6c1c7a6d7a60ed62c", "ja": "パワー……アップ～！　ふっふっふ。\n自分は一番のアイドルだからね。誰にも負けないさー！", "zh": "力量……提升～！哼哼哼。\n因为我可是最棒的偶像。不会输给任何人啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0364_1010_013hib", "source_sha256": "45df9db26d99912e763d9101d9b603bd6f1e8db3f88b97dd4b9114f52a0a3d6f", "ja": "もちろん、真とか歩とか、\nカッコいいアイドルはいっぱいいるけど……。", "zh": "当然，像真和步那样，\n帅气的偶像还有很多就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0364_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "828dc9337f34bca498da997448090d87d6bc79773ceb6b7af27bf13003b05b20", "ja": "ライバルのみんながいるから、自分は強くなれるし、\nもっとカッコよくなれるんだよね！", "zh": "正因为有这些竞争对手，我才能变得更强，也能变得更加帅气！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0364_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d018e249e22c6e9fba4f2cd7e731b412dd6e02788bac5d908fb8ddf4e8639dd6", "ja": "ああ。ひとりで強くなるのも限界があるしな。\n他の人と切磋琢磨して、より高みを目指せる……。", "zh": "是啊。一个人变强也是有极限的。\n和其他人相互切磋，才能向更高的境界迈进……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0364_1013_013hib", "source_sha256": "e3707ac8889fcdb5d43c26387c3c71f5136ff5d4a334619621475aaa75d4f4ac", "ja": "そうだね。いつもステージに立つのが楽しみなのは、\nファンの人たちが来てくれるからだし……。", "zh": "是啊。每次都期待登上舞台，也是因为粉丝们会来支持我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0364_1014_013hib", "source_sha256": "b21191065b684dfb57de83bc19112e65dfaffb604ab38d241648f9b18c23e148", "ja": "悲しいことがあっても、踏ん張れるのは、\n大切な家族がいてくれるおかげだもんね！", "zh": "即使遇到难过的事，也能坚持下来，都是因为有重要的家人在身边嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0364_1015_p", "source_sha256": "152ce86a5484619053c1499fe4c6ef4bbb5a4a563fcbd508c9c4a78a3dacbc62", "ja": "そうだな。ってことは、\n響の強さは、絆の大切さなのかもしれないな。", "zh": "是啊。也就是说，响的坚强，或许正是因为明白羁绊的珍贵吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0364_1016_013hib", "source_sha256": "7e7d388128ea86735857cfd6fd6ff2cd5ce564f9bc03c7d94e6b495e4b695e88", "ja": "あ、そうかも！　どんな時も\nみんなのことを考えると、自分、頑張れるんだ！", "zh": "啊，说不定真是这样！每当想到大家，我就能努力下去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0364_1017_013hib", "source_sha256": "942d3e879d8fd6f177c9dd38162b5f83e3e6f35d679512a3a0c47bd65f930275", "ja": "みんなが応援してくれて、笑顔になって……。\nそう思ったら、もっともっと頑張らなきゃって！", "zh": "大家为我加油，让我露出笑容……一想到这些，我就觉得自己必须更加努力才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0364_1018_p", "source_sha256": "2d44ee34e47b590b3dc36dd508dff2b66da4e25432a366a2e812c58f181e4934", "ja": "さすがだな、響！　それなら次のライブは、\nより一層燃えている姿を見られそうだな！", "zh": "不愧是你啊，响！既然这样，看来下次演唱会能看到你更加燃情的表现了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0364_1019_013hib", "source_sha256": "1b14b76bd63a4ee8bfefbbf6cb712827b56d732a4821c53fe995b6117032accf", "ja": "ふふん、言われなくても、やる気は十分さー！\nカンペキ以上のカンペキな自分を見せてあげるね！", "zh": "哼哼，不用你说，我的干劲已经十足啦——！\n我会让你见识一下超越完美的完美自己！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
